Use io, list, and string.

Let text be str_from_bytes(bytes_ptr("babad"), bytes_len("babad")).
Let n be length of address of text.
Let best_low start at 0 as an unsigned number.
Let best_span start at 0 as an unsigned number.

For every i from 0 as an unsigned number to n - 1:
    For every j from i to n - 1:
        Let palindrome be true.
        Let low_index start at i.
        Let high_index start at j.
        Repeat while low_index is less than high_index:
            If text.data[low_index] isn't equal to text.data[high_index]:
                Set palindrome to false.
                Break.
            Add 1 to low_index.
            Subtract 1 from high_index.
        If palindrome is true:
            Let span be j - i + 1.
            If span is more than best_span:
                Set best_span to span.
                Set best_low to i.

Let answer be create text from (text.data as an unsigned number plus best_low) as a pointer to byte of length best_span.
Say answer.
str_free(address of answer).
str_free(address of text).
Return 0.
